  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: a9bf988a-4b17-4a1b-967f-e042ce9e31da
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • Nov 2024 achieved highest sales at $118,448, indicating strong recent performance
        • Dec 2023 reached $96,999, showing consistent holiday season strength
        • Sep 2021 hit $81,777, suggesting seasonal patterns in Q3-Q4 periods
        • 48-month data span reveals cyclical trends with peak performance in late-year months

        Recommendations:
        • Focus marketing efforts on replicating Nov 2024 success factors in upcoming months
        • Strengthen Q4 holiday campaigns given consistent Dec performance
        • Analyze Q1-Q2 underperformance to boost off-season sales
